{
  "name": "@dsh-local/snoopy-pet",
  "version": "2.5.0",
  "description": "DeepSeek Harness 桌面小宠（snoopy-pet）：精灵图动画桌面小宠，两脚站立/行走、可拖动、悬停即停、可缩放、分时段弹语（1000 条，可指定路径替换）、对话完成语音提醒、桌面画中画（出去/回去）、往返巡逻，支持配置精灵图目录更换形象。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": true
    }
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE",
    "dev"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "client-plugin",
    "desktop-pet",
    "pet"
  ]
}
